{title: Deva Shree Ganesha}
{artist: Ajay Atul Agnipath}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C],        Jwaala si jalti hai
[C#],        aankhon mein jiske bhi
[A#m] [C],        Dil mein tera naam hai
[C],        Parwaah hi kya uska
[C#],        aarambh kaisa hai
[A#m] [C],        aur kaisa parinaam hai
[F],        Dharti ambar sitaare hai
[F] [C#],        Uski nazarein utaarein
[F],        Darr bhi uss se dara re
[F] [C#],        Jiski rakhwaliya re
[D#] [A#m],        Karta saaya tera
[C] [A#m] [C],        Deva Shree Ganesha (x8)
[C] [C#] [C],        Ho..Teri bhakti to vardaan hai
[C] [C#] [C],        Jo kamaaye woh dhanwaan hai
[F] [D#],        Bin kinare ki kashti hai woh
[D#] [A#m] [C#],        Deva, Tujhse jo anjaan hai
[C] [C#] [C],        Yun tto mooshak sawaari teri
[C] [C#] [C],        Sab pe hai pehredaari teri
[F] [D#],        Paap ki aandhiyaan laakh ho
[D#] [A#m] [C#],        Kabhi jyoti na haari teri
[F],        Apni taqdeer ka woh,
[F] [C#],        khud sikander huaa re
[F],        Bhool ke yeh jahaan re
[F] [C#],        Jis kisi ne yahaan re
[D#] [A#m],        Saath paaya tera..
